note seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/om2fn.om: fstatfs is program-only (Main's binding decision): unlike fstat, an OM-2
note function unit (no fn main) refuses it too, error 9.
om2
fn peek fd int to long
s = new uchar 120 0
ret fstatfs fd s 0 120
end
note gate-pools: uses fstatfs on purpose: owner=seed/host/fstatfs/check.sh new-word acceptance or refusal qualification
